%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor':'#e8f4f8', 'primaryTextColor':'#2c3e50', 'primaryBorderColor':'#3498db', 'lineColor':'#3498db', 'secondaryColor':'#f0f9ff', 'tertiaryColor':'#e0f2fe', 'noteBkgColor':'#fff7ed', 'noteTextColor':'#2c3e50', 'noteBorderColor':'#f59e0b', 'activationBkgColor':'#dbeafe', 'activationBorderColor':'#3b82f6'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as VersionHistoryPanel
    participant FSS as FileSystemService
    participant MinIO as MinIO

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over User,MinIO: View Version History
    end

    User->>UI: Click "Version History" button
    activate UI

    UI->>FSS: getVersions()
    activate FSS

    FSS->>MinIO: listObjects(IncludeVersion: true)
    activate MinIO
    MinIO-->>FSS: Stream of version objects
    deactivate MinIO

    FSS->>FSS: Transform to FileVersion[] format
    FSS-->>UI: {success: true, versions: [...]}
    deactivate FSS

    UI->>UI: Display version timeline with timestamps and metadata
    UI-->>User: Show versions with timestamps
    deactivate UI
